  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "The new textbox UI has changed functionality of the vr textbox. instead of being able to move the keyboard and the textbox, only the keyboard can be moved, leaving the textbox in a fixed position. This essentially makes it impossible to type while in any position that isn't looking straight ahead and feels like desktop mode functionality poorly adapted to VR. Additionally, the ability to lock and unlock the textbox/keyboard position has been removed. A change like this should not come with such massive regression of already existing features players are used to having.",
